WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.866 --> 00:00:03.800
Following Gurkinn's instructions,

2
00:00:03.866 --> 00:00:07.233
Korrina and our heroes have traveled to Pomace Mountain.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.466
Now they've arrived at the manor of a Trainer

4
00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:12.633
whose Pokémon partner is able to Mega Evolve.

5
00:00:14.399 --> 00:00:17.700
Hello there? I'm Korrina from Shalour City!

6
00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:19.966
My grandfather told me to come and see you!

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.700
- Mai.
- Huh?

8
00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:27.799
Hey, who's that Pokémon?

9
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.866
Mawile, the Deceiver Pokémon.

10
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:37.199
Mawile's horns form a huge set of jaws, strong enough to chew up an iron beam.

11
00:00:37.266 --> 00:00:39.566
So, where's your Trainer?

12
00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:42.233
- Over here!
- Huh?

13
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.033
Mawile!

14
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.300
Thank you so much for watching the house, Mawile.

15
00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:57.366
Oh! My stars! Well. How do you do? I'm Mabel.

16
00:00:57.433 --> 00:01:00.433
- I'm Korrina.
- Hi there. My name's Ash.

17
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.933
- Pikachu!
- I'm Serena. Nice to meet you!

18
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.666
- My name's Bonnie. This is Dedenne.
- Na-na!

19
00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.566
- That's my brother.
- My name's Clemont.

20
00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:12.666
- Pleased to meet you!
- I was told you were coming.

21
00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:16.933
First, why don't the two of you demonstrate how strong you are?

22
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.933
- Huh? Sure.
- Hm?

23
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.800
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

24
00:01:22.866 --> 00:01:26.533
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

25
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.066
♪ To catch them is my real test

26
00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:32.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

27
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

28
00:01:35.366 --> 00:01:38.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

29
00:01:38.566 --> 00:01:41.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

30
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

31
00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:46.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

32
00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:49.933
♪ Got to catch them all Pokémon! ♪

33
00:02:02.699 --> 00:02:04.199
All right , let's begin.

34
00:02:04.266 --> 00:02:07.233
Ready, Lucario? Mega Evolve!

35
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:21.466
Lucario has such a fine aura.

36
00:02:21.533 --> 00:02:23.733
Now, Mawile, Mega Evolve!

37
00:02:24.766 --> 00:02:27.600
Mawile!

38
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.833
- Mawile did it, too!
- So that's a Mega Mawile!

39
00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.200
I can't wait to see how this battle turns out!

40
00:02:38.266 --> 00:02:42.533
- Pika! Pika!
- All right. Power-Up Punch!

41
00:02:45.966 --> 00:02:48.900
- Jump, please.
- Mawile!

42
00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.166
Bone Rush? I see.

43
00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:01.600
Now, let's go for it!

44
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:04.533
-All right, Mawile, dodge it.

45
00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.066
- Yeah! Atta--
- Korrina!

46
00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:16.033
Huh? Can't battle this way.

47
00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.000
And now, Mawile, use Iron Head.

48
00:03:19.066 --> 00:03:23.266
Mawile!

49
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:24.799
Huh?

50
00:03:24.866 --> 00:03:28.866
Lucario, no! I need you to listen to what I tell you to do, okay?

51
00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:32.299
-Not again. Uh-oh!

52
00:03:32.366 --> 00:03:34.033
Oh! Lucario?

53
00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.533
Its aura is causing it to lose control again!

54
00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:45.166
Lucario! Lucario, stay with me!

55
00:03:48.733 --> 00:03:50.566
- No, Lucario!
- Hmm.

56
00:03:50.633 --> 00:03:53.200
Calm down, Lucario!

57
00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:55.500
Lucario can't hear a thing you say!

58
00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:59.533
-Mawile, Fairy Wind!

59
00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:03.633
Ma!

60
00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.799
- Lucario!

61
00:04:11.866 --> 00:04:13.366
Lucario!

62
00:04:14.533 --> 00:04:18.433
It looks like that's it. Very well done, Mawile.

63
00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.966
Mawile!

64
00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:24.166
I know you're going to be just fine.

65
00:04:24.233 --> 00:04:27.433
Don't worry. You'll be able to control your powers in no time!

66
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.966
Remember? That's what we came here for!

67
00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:34.500
We promise we'll do our best! Please help us, Mabel!

68
00:04:36.266 --> 00:04:40.966
Ha. That Mega Mawile could come in quite handy, you know?

69
00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:44.500
Once we catch Pikachu and those two Mega-Evolving Pokémon,

70
00:04:44.566 --> 00:04:47.400
we'll get our paws on their Key Stones and Mega Stones

71
00:04:47.466 --> 00:04:50.800
and then we'll create a magnificent Mega Evolution mob

72
00:04:50.866 --> 00:04:53.966
that'll be mighty at manipulating the masses!

73
00:04:54.033 --> 00:04:57.166
But still, Mega Mawile's Fairy Wind is quite powerful.

74
00:04:57.233 --> 00:04:59.966
We probably won't stand a chance with a head-on attack.

75
00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:03.599
Then we'll catch them off guard. We'll maintain our stance

76
00:05:03.666 --> 00:05:06.266
- and wait for the chance!
- Wobbuffet!

77
00:05:07.566 --> 00:05:11.666
- Oh! Pretty flowers!
- Thanks. I picked them earlier.

78
00:05:11.733 --> 00:05:14.099
And since they're so beautiful, I thought I'd have

79
00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:17.033
Korrina and Lucario make an arrangement for me.

80
00:05:17.099 --> 00:05:22.166
Oh! I'm sorry, but I think our time would be much better spent doing some training.

81
00:05:22.233 --> 00:05:24.533
-No need to be so hasty.

82
00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:28.533
Would you all like to make some flower arrangements, too?

83
00:05:28.599 --> 00:05:30.900
- Wow, really?
- We can do it, too?

84
00:05:30.966 --> 00:05:34.866
Of course, but I'd like you to do it with your Pokémon partners.

85
00:05:34.933 --> 00:05:38.099
- Dedenne, yay!
- Na-na-na!

86
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.333
Hey, that sounds like a lot of fun.

87
00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.066
- What do you say, Pikachu?
- Pika!

88
00:05:46.099 --> 00:05:48.000
They're such beautiful flowers!

89
00:05:48.066 --> 00:05:51.033
- And the colors match your fur!
- Fennekin!

90
00:05:51.099 --> 00:05:53.266
I love flowers so much!

91
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:56.033
- Let's use lots of them!
- Nenne!

92
00:05:56.099 --> 00:05:59.766
- We'll make the biggest arrangement!
- Pikachu!

93
00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:02.000
Well, we'll make the best one!

94
00:06:02.066 --> 00:06:04.933
It's a flower competition!

95
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:09.400
Chespin, the future is now, thanks to science.

96
00:06:09.466 --> 00:06:11.099
Clemontic Gear on!

97
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.599
Data from every work of art since the beginning of time has been inputted!

98
00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:18.599
This device possesses the ultimate artistic taste! Its name?

99
00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:19.766
Che!

100
00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:24.233
- Flower Arranger One.
- Flower Arranger One?

101
00:06:24.299 --> 00:06:27.433
You're real good at coming up with obvious names!

102
00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.099
I want you to witness the future of flower arrangement! Huh!

103
00:06:31.166 --> 00:06:32.700
Power on!

104
00:06:36.233 --> 00:06:40.166
- Science is so amazing!
- Pika!

105
00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:43.933
- You're doing great too, Chespin!
- Che. Che.

106
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.466
Che, che, che, che, che, che, che, che, che, che, che!

107
00:06:47.533 --> 00:06:52.233
Uh-oh. Oh no! It appears that my flower arrangement from the future

108
00:06:52.299 --> 00:06:54.599
doesn't know when to stop arranging!

109
00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:56.633
- Huh?
- Huh?

110
00:06:59.466 --> 00:07:03.033
- Oh no. I'd just finished!

111
00:07:03.099 --> 00:07:06.099
I'm sorry, big brother, but that was just horrible!

112
00:07:06.166 --> 00:07:08.266
- Na-na!
- I'm sorry, too!

113
00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:09.400
Chespin.

114
00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:16.900
Well done, everyone. Your arrangements are a reflection of your personalities.

115
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:20.333
From this arrangement, I can see that as a Trainer and Pokémon,

116
00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.299
Ash's and Pikachu's hearts have become one.

117
00:07:23.366 --> 00:07:27.400
- This is a very powerful piece.
- Wow, thank you so much!

118
00:07:27.466 --> 00:07:31.500
It looks like you and Lucario have made two arrangements in one.

119
00:07:31.566 --> 00:07:33.633
That's right! It's pretty, huh?

120
00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:38.233
Yes. From this arrangement, I can see that you have similar personalities

121
00:07:38.299 --> 00:07:40.599
and understand each other deeply.

122
00:07:40.666 --> 00:07:44.166
Yup! We've been together since we were little, so we're connected!

123
00:07:44.233 --> 00:07:46.633
We have such a strong bond!

124
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:52.133
I see. Well, then, I'll look forward to impressive arrangements tomorrow, too.

125
00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.133
We're making arrangements tomorrow, too?

126
00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.599
No way! What about all of our training?

127
00:07:56.666 --> 00:08:01.900
No need to be so hasty. For now I look forward to tomorrow.

128
00:08:05.799 --> 00:08:09.166
- All right, off we go!
- Be careful, please!

129
00:08:09.233 --> 00:08:12.433
- Bye! I'll find the prettiest flowers!
- Hey, wait up!

130
00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.733
- Korrina?
- Huh?

131
00:08:13.799 --> 00:08:16.799
I hope you notice how beautiful the mountains are,

132
00:08:16.866 --> 00:08:21.466
- especially with your partner, Lucario.
- Huh? Mountain views?

133
00:08:21.533 --> 00:08:25.900
And if you do, I'm sure something wonderful will happen.

134
00:08:43.633 --> 00:08:46.633
Wonder what she meant by something wonderful.

135
00:08:46.699 --> 00:08:50.199
I just don't understand.

136
00:08:50.266 --> 00:08:52.633
-Huh?

137
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.566
Who's that Pokémon?

138
00:09:03.066 --> 00:09:05.266
It's Mawile!

139
00:09:09.933 --> 00:09:12.400
Everyone did great today, too!

140
00:09:12.466 --> 00:09:16.633
I'll be looking forward to even more wonderful arrangements tomorrow.

141
00:09:16.699 --> 00:09:19.233
- Tomorrow, too?
- Pika?

142
00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.233
- Yes. Tomorrow and the day after.
- Huh?

143
00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.833
But we've had enough of arranging flowers!

144
00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.533
-Don't say that.

145
00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.133
I want to see the beautiful flower arrangements

146
00:09:29.199 --> 00:09:34.366
that you and Lucario make when both your hearts are one. Please!

147
00:09:58.366 --> 00:10:03.933
Huh? Look at those pretty flowers!

148
00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:08.333
All right. I'll climb up and get some!

149
00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.733
Hup!

150
00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.166
Thanks, Lucario.

151
00:10:14.233 --> 00:10:15.533
-Huh?

152
00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.933
-Lucario!

153
00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.000
-Hold on a sec!

154
00:10:24.066 --> 00:10:26.866
Looks like parts of the cliff aren't as sturdy as others.

155
00:10:26.933 --> 00:10:29.100
I'll let you know what direction to climb!

156
00:10:31.199 --> 00:10:32.666
Go right!

157
00:10:32.733 --> 00:10:35.033
Go left! Straight up!

158
00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.933
Now move left! More to the left!

159
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.199
Now go right!

160
00:10:41.266 --> 00:10:43.566
Left!

161
00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.033
Ha!

162
00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.233
You're there!

163
00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.333
What do you think?

164
00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.033
- Gorgeous!
- Sure is!

165
00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.366
Hmm.

166
00:11:01.233 --> 00:11:05.100
I'm getting kind of bored. If I have to arrange one more flower,

167
00:11:05.166 --> 00:11:08.933
I'm going to scream. I know they're pretty and everything, but still.

168
00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.733
I like it! I'm having so much fun!

169
00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:13.433
Nenne!

170
00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:18.233
I wonder why Mabel keeps on making us arrange flowers day after day.

171
00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.633
- Pika.
- Hm.

172
00:11:19.699 --> 00:11:23.166
Well, she must have a good reason for doing it, but what?

173
00:11:23.233 --> 00:11:25.699
This doesn't make any sense to me.

174
00:11:25.766 --> 00:11:28.933
At this rate, you'll never be able to control your aura.

175
00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.666
-When are we going to start training?

176
00:11:35.833 --> 00:11:38.833
How will we ever make good on our Pokémon pinching plan

177
00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.933
with her there all the live long day?

178
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:44.233
Right. They're always arranging flowers with that woman.

179
00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.233
We can't catch anything but a cold.

180
00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:50.199
Don't throw in the towel just yet! We've got to keep keeping on!

181
00:11:50.266 --> 00:11:51.933
Wobbuffet!

182
00:11:55.266 --> 00:11:58.366
Huh? Would you take these?

183
00:11:58.433 --> 00:12:01.766
- I'll meet you up there.
- Ma.

184
00:12:03.466 --> 00:12:06.600
So weird. I wonder why Grandfather insisted

185
00:12:06.666 --> 00:12:09.800
that we come and visit Mabel in the first place.

186
00:12:09.866 --> 00:12:13.000
The moon looks the same as it did the night we were separated.

187
00:12:13.066 --> 00:12:15.900
Remember? You were looking at it too, weren't you?

188
00:12:15.966 --> 00:12:19.100
- My, what a beautiful moon!

189
00:12:19.166 --> 00:12:21.100
- Mabel?
- It's all right.

190
00:12:21.166 --> 00:12:24.500
You needn't worry. You're almost there.

191
00:12:24.566 --> 00:12:28.666
Soon, you'll both be able to control Lucario's aura during Mega Evolution.

192
00:12:28.733 --> 00:12:32.333
Control its aura? Are you finally going to teach us how to do that?

193
00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.833
- I've been teaching you all along.
- Huh?

194
00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.866
The reason why I asked you to look at the mountains together

195
00:12:38.933 --> 00:12:41.533
and make all those flower arrangements was because it was

196
00:12:41.599 --> 00:12:44.400
the most effective training for the two of you.

197
00:12:44.466 --> 00:12:48.800
What's most important to me is the way the two of you perceive things.

198
00:12:48.866 --> 00:12:52.000
You and Lucario are obviously very close.

199
00:12:52.066 --> 00:12:54.300
The two of you think and act alike.

200
00:12:54.366 --> 00:12:57.666
That's why Lucario used moves without your command

201
00:12:57.733 --> 00:13:03.033
and made its own decisions during battle and both of you were all right with that.

202
00:13:03.099 --> 00:13:05.566
Trainers and their Pokémon are partners.

203
00:13:05.633 --> 00:13:08.099
While they may work together toward the same goals,

204
00:13:08.166 --> 00:13:09.800
their roles are quite different.

205
00:13:09.866 --> 00:13:13.366
You see, although you both may be looking at the same thing,

206
00:13:13.433 --> 00:13:15.833
perhaps you're viewing it differently.

207
00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:19.033
- Huh?
- One heart, two viewpoints.

208
00:13:19.099 --> 00:13:22.766
You have to bring them together and transform that into strength.

209
00:13:22.833 --> 00:13:25.766
There's no doubt in my mind the two of you can do that.

210
00:13:25.833 --> 00:13:29.500
One heart, two viewpoints. Bring them together.

211
00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.000
- Pika!
- Pikachu!

212
00:13:32.066 --> 00:13:33.333
Mawile!

213
00:13:35.966 --> 00:13:38.133
- Pikachu!
- Mawile!

214
00:13:38.199 --> 00:13:39.933
What happened?

215
00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.866
I think something crashed through that window!

216
00:13:41.933 --> 00:13:44.133
Whatever it was took Pikachu and Mawile!

217
00:13:44.199 --> 00:13:47.099
- Huh?
- My stars, what happened?

218
00:13:50.599 --> 00:13:53.933
- It's Pikachu and Mawile!
- Who in the world are they?

219
00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.166
Prepare for trouble, your question is flawed!

220
00:13:56.233 --> 00:13:58.400
We're out of this world, so you should be awed!

221
00:13:58.466 --> 00:14:00.966
To protect the world from devastation!

222
00:14:01.033 --> 00:14:03.766
To unite all people within our nation!

223
00:14:03.833 --> 00:14:06.599
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

224
00:14:06.666 --> 00:14:09.466
To extend our reach to the stars above!

225
00:14:10.333 --> 00:14:12.033
- Jessie!
- And James!

226
00:14:12.933 --> 00:14:15.633
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

227
00:14:15.699 --> 00:14:18.599
Surrender now or prepare for a fortitudinous fight!

228
00:14:18.666 --> 00:14:22.166
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

229
00:14:23.266 --> 00:14:25.699
- Team Rocket?
- They're bad guys who always try

230
00:14:25.766 --> 00:14:28.300
to steal other people's Pokémon!

231
00:14:28.366 --> 00:14:30.199
-So true!

232
00:14:30.266 --> 00:14:33.666
And to make our reputation intact, we'll now take them from you!

233
00:14:33.733 --> 00:14:36.666
And Lucario, too!

234
00:14:36.733 --> 00:14:39.533
Dodge it!

235
00:14:39.599 --> 00:14:41.566
Set Pikachu and Mawile free!

236
00:14:41.633 --> 00:14:44.966
Please! That sounds just like a second-rate song lyric.

237
00:14:45.033 --> 00:14:46.766
Pumpkaboo, let's go!

238
00:14:46.833 --> 00:14:48.599
Pumpkaboo.

239
00:14:48.666 --> 00:14:50.466
Hm.

240
00:14:50.533 --> 00:14:54.033
You're right! They've got to be rescued and we can do it!

241
00:14:54.099 --> 00:14:56.766
Ready, Lucario?

242
00:14:56.833 --> 00:14:59.199
Lucario, Mega Evolve!

243
00:15:06.699 --> 00:15:09.666
-Lucario, Power-Up Punch!

244
00:15:11.033 --> 00:15:13.066
-Not today.

245
00:15:13.133 --> 00:15:15.133
Okay, Inkay, Psybeam!

246
00:15:15.199 --> 00:15:17.800
Inkay!

247
00:15:21.066 --> 00:15:22.599
-Lucario!

248
00:15:22.666 --> 00:15:26.566
Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

249
00:15:26.633 --> 00:15:29.900
- Inkay, use Psybeam!
- Inkay!

250
00:15:38.166 --> 00:15:39.566
Oh, no!

251
00:15:39.633 --> 00:15:42.099
Lucario's aura's making it lose control!

252
00:15:46.833 --> 00:15:49.800
-What do I do now?

253
00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.266
- Huh?
- I have faith in you.

254
00:15:54.433 --> 00:15:57.066
Hm. Right!

255
00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.199
Shadow Ball, more!

256
00:16:02.266 --> 00:16:03.766
Use Tackle!

257
00:16:11.699 --> 00:16:14.633
Lucario!

258
00:16:14.699 --> 00:16:16.699
One heart, two viewpoints.

259
00:16:16.766 --> 00:16:19.433
I've got to pay close attention to what's going on

260
00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.800
and help Lucario out however I can!

261
00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.866
Lucario! Please, listen to me.

262
00:16:34.933 --> 00:16:38.433
One heart, two viewpoints. Remember that?

263
00:16:44.666 --> 00:16:50.166
We've got to bring them together and transform that into strength!

264
00:16:56.366 --> 00:16:59.500
Lucario! Lucario!

265
00:16:59.566 --> 00:17:05.766
Remember. Our hearts are one. Let your aura take over your body!

266
00:17:15.633 --> 00:17:18.800
Save the mushy stuff for later! Pumpkaboo, use Dark Pulse!

267
00:17:24.966 --> 00:17:28.899
Lucario!

268
00:17:28.966 --> 00:17:31.566
- Wow!
- Korrina's voice got through!

269
00:17:33.133 --> 00:17:35.333
All right, ready?

270
00:17:36.766 --> 00:17:40.200
Now, Inkay, the third Psybeam's the charm!

271
00:17:40.266 --> 00:17:42.533
Okay, counter it!

272
00:17:43.633 --> 00:17:46.533
Shadow Ball again!

273
00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:51.000
It's attacking from the left! Dodge upward and hit the Shadow Ball!

274
00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.300
Now Bone Rush!

275
00:18:07.399 --> 00:18:09.333
Pika!

276
00:18:09.399 --> 00:18:10.766
- Pikachu!
- Pika!

277
00:18:10.833 --> 00:18:12.200
- Mawile!
- Mawile!

278
00:18:13.766 --> 00:18:16.433
We're not going to take that lying down!

279
00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.633
-Now, isn't that a coincidence?

280
00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:23.366
Neither are we. Mawile, Mega Evolve!

281
00:18:24.633 --> 00:18:29.633
Mawile!

282
00:18:30.633 --> 00:18:33.133
Wrap it up with Dark Pulse!

283
00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:38.333
Now, use Fairy Wind!

284
00:18:39.833 --> 00:18:41.800
Inkay, use Psybeam!

285
00:18:41.866 --> 00:18:43.433
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, go!

286
00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:47.500
Pikachu!

287
00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.433
Lucario! That's it!

288
00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.600
You learned a new move!

289
00:18:53.666 --> 00:18:56.500
Then let's let them have it! Aura Sphere!

290
00:19:03.166 --> 00:19:06.166
- We're blasting off...

291
00:19:06.233 --> 00:19:09.600
- Wob!
- Again!

292
00:19:09.666 --> 00:19:10.733
Yay!

293
00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.933
Wow, that Aura Sphere happened because their hearts became one!

294
00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.800
Pika!

295
00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.433
Lucario, we did it!

296
00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.300
Hm!

297
00:19:28.833 --> 00:19:33.266
Thank you for everything. We're really glad we came here to see you.

298
00:19:33.333 --> 00:19:38.766
You're most welcome. Remember, although you're now able to control Lucario's aura,

299
00:19:38.833 --> 00:19:41.033
you must continue to work hard and improve.

300
00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.066
Right! We sure will!

301
00:19:43.133 --> 00:19:45.233
Hm.

302
00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:48.899
- Korrina, guess this is goodbye.
- Huh?

303
00:19:48.966 --> 00:19:52.100
Why? Aren't we all going to the same place?

304
00:19:52.166 --> 00:19:54.433
Yeah, we're all going to the Shalour Gym together,

305
00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.966
- so you can challenge Korrina.
- Serena's right.

306
00:19:57.033 --> 00:20:01.366
Korrina and Lucario can control its aura, so we need to train even harder!

307
00:20:01.433 --> 00:20:05.133
We'll get stronger and stronger, then we can challenge her and win that badge!

308
00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:08.500
- We'll do our very best to win!
- Pika!

309
00:20:08.566 --> 00:20:11.633
I understand! Then we'll see you there!

310
00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.766
Come on, Lucario!

311
00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.933
See you later!

312
00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.366
Bye, Korrina! Bye Lucario! See you soon!

313
00:20:22.433 --> 00:20:23.933
Take care of yourselves!

314
00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:27.033
Don't forget to say hi to your grandfather for us!

315
00:20:29.766 --> 00:20:32.300
Let's move it!

316
00:20:32.366 --> 00:20:35.866
Thanks to Mabel's guidance, Korrina and Lucario have learned

317
00:20:35.933 --> 00:20:40.033
how to control the power of Lucario's aura during Mega Evolution.

318
00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:43.466
Now, with Ash's Shalour Gym battle on their minds,

319
00:20:43.533 --> 00:20:46.433
our heroes' journey continues!
